<item>
<title>[POPV-959] Handling 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error.</title>
<link>https://vts.vatech.com/browse/POPV-959</link>
<project id="16002" key="POPV">ES_EzDentWeb_PRJ관리</project>
<description><div class='je_rdata_container je_html' style='text-align:start'><div class='je_preview'><p><strong>Background</strong></p> <ul> <li>'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error occurs for various reasons.</li> <li>If the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error occurs,&nbsp;The resource in WebGL is no longer valid.&nbsp;</li> <li>So the view is displayed abnormally.</li> <li>In&nbsp;<a class="issue-link" href="https://vts.vatech.com/browse/POPV-216"><del>POPV-216</del></a>, the views display the black screen due to the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Purpose</strong></p> <ul> <li>Handle the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error to avoid displaying abnormal&nbsp;rendering results.</li> </ul> <p><strong>Process</strong></p> <ol> <li>Find out how to handle the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL'.</li> <li>Apply exception error handling and the view initialization.</li> </ol> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Considerable Factors</strong></p> <ul> <li>AzureDevOps Issue <ul> <li>3DViewer:&nbsp;<a href="https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1635/">https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1635/</a>&nbsp;</li> <li>2DViewer:&nbsp;<a href="https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1648">https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1648</a>&nbsp;</li> </ul> </li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p> <p><strong>Result Image</strong></p> <ul> <li>The view is not displayed abnormally by the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error.</li> </ul> <p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class='je_sep' style='display:none'>&nbsp;&zwnj;</div><div class='je_cdata' style='display:none'><!--&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error occurs for various reasons.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;If the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error occurs,&amp;nbsp;The resource in WebGL is no longer valid.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;So the view is displayed abnormally.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;In&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class="issue-link" title="[Main Menu] [Open CT] The 3D volume or all layouts display as black when opening a JPEG Compress CT image" href="https://vts.vatech.com/browse/POPV-216" data-issue-key="POPV-216"&gt;&lt;del&gt;POPV-216&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;, the views display the black screen due to the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Handle the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error to avoid displaying abnormal&amp;nbsp;rendering results.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ol&gt; &lt;li&gt;Find out how to handle the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL'.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Apply exception error handling and the view initialization.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ol&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Considerable Factors&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;AzureDevOps Issue &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;3DViewer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1635/"&gt;https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1635/&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;2DViewer:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href="https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1648"&gt;https://dev.azure.com/ewoosoft/popv/_workitems/edit/1648&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Result Image&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;The view is not displayed abnormally by the 'CONTEXT_LOST_WEBGL' error.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt; --></div><div class='je_cdata_js je_cgt' style='display:none'><!----></div><div class='je_cdata_styles je_cgt' style='display:none'><!----></div><div class='je_pr_rrj je_cgt' style='display:none'><!--[{"from":"<base href=","to":"<a href="},{"from":"white-space: nowrap;","to":""}]--></div><div class='je_pr_ssj je_cgt' style='display:none'><!--{"sf":true,"dir_auto":true,"rs":true}--></div><div class='je_pr_atj je_cgt' style='display:none'><!--[]--></div><span class='jeditor_renderer' renderer='html' key='POPV-